<h4 dir="auto">Summary</h4>
<p dir="auto">Firefox 147 adds support for unitless <code class="notranslate">-webkit-perspective</code> values, for increased compatibility. See <a href="https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1362499" rel="nofollow">https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1362499</a>.</p>
